   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1.1.1.1:  Integrated competitiveness framework and implementation models in place
1.1 Number of Road Maps developed
1.2 Number of the SME Digital Solutions Platform on Industry and Tourism Sector established (IRRF Indicator DD-1)
1.2 Number of the SMEs entered in the platform and networking activities conducted for cooperation (at least 15 % women-led SMEs)

2.1 Number of Incentive Support Programmes designed and implemented which co-designed with women, based on gender equality principles.
2.2 Number of persons (or SMEs) reached with Technical Help Desk Services disaggregated by sex (at least 20 % being women) (IRRF Indicator SP-4)
2.2 Number of private sector companies supported during and after the COVID-19 pandemic through the incentive support program (at least 20 % being women-led SMEs)  (IRRF Indicator SP-4)
2.3 Increment in the SME digitalization in the selected pilot regions  
2.4 Number of the Digital Modules developed for M&amp;E of the programmes
2.5 Number of SMEs that took part in capacity building/dissemination events and created change in the way of their business (IRRF Indicator SP-4)
2.6 Number of the inclusive business models developed and replicated (scalable replicable tool kits developed) (IRRF Indicator DD-1)</narrative>
    </description>
